{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"阿摩司書","commonName":"阿摩司書","title":"阿摩司書","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"18d605b76ce0ce8b7896c55a048971d827e454f0d479e5d953f3671430cf12f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["一筐水果的異象"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["主耶和華又指示我一件事：我看見一筐夏天的果子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他說：「阿摩司啊，你看見甚麼？」我說：「看見一筐夏天的果子。」耶和華說：「我民以色列的結局到了，我必不再寬恕他們。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["主耶和華說：「那日，殿中的詩歌變為哀號；必有許多屍首在各處拋棄，無人作聲。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的結局"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"你們這些要吞吃窮乏人、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使困苦人衰敗的，當聽我的話！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們說：月朔幾時過去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們好賣糧；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"安息日幾時過去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們好擺開麥子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"賣出用小升斗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收銀用大戥子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用詭詐的天平欺哄人，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好用銀子買貧寒人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用一雙鞋換窮乏人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將壞了的麥子賣給人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"耶和華指着雅各的榮耀起誓說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的一切行為，我必永遠不忘。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地豈不因這事震動？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其上的居民不也悲哀嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地必全然像尼羅河漲起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同埃及河湧上落下。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"主耶和華說：到那日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使日頭在午間落下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使地在白晝黑暗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使你們的節期變為悲哀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歌曲變為哀歌。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾人腰束麻布，頭上光禿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使這場悲哀如喪獨生子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至終如痛苦的日子一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"主耶和華說：日子將到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必命饑荒降在地上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人飢餓非因無餅，乾渴非因無水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乃因不聽耶和華的話。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必飄流，從這海到那海，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從北邊到東邊，往來奔跑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尋求耶和華的話，卻尋不着。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"當那日，美貌的處女","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和少年的男子必因乾渴發昏。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那指着撒馬利亞牛犢","poem":1},{"noteId":4},{"text":"起誓的說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但哪，我們指着你那裏的活神起誓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又說：我們指着別是巴的神道","poem":1},{"noteId":5},{"text":"起誓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些人都必仆倒，永不再起來。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"-","text":"原文是罪","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":14}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"-","text":"神：原文是活","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":14}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/AMO/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}